{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21569","headline":"送岭南崔侍御 · 元稹","name":"送岭南崔侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我是北人长北望，每嗟南雁更南飞。\n君今又作岭南别，南雁北归君未归。\n洞主参承惊豸角，岛夷安集慕霜威。\n黄家贼用鑹刀利，白水郎行旱地稀。\n蜃吐朝光楼隐隐，鳌吹细浪雨霏霏。\n毒龙蜕骨轰雷鼓，野象埋牙斸石矶。\n火布垢尘须火浣，木绵温软当绵衣。\n桄榔麪碜槟榔涩，海气常昏海日微。\n蛟老变爲妖妇女，舶来多卖假珠玑。\n此中无限相忧事，请爲殷勤事事依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}